 "integration": {
  "summary": "Leave SW3.8 on for BACnet MS/TP, give each cassette a unique MAC (0-63) on SW1; the device ID is 315000 + MAC. Switch the unit with BV 0 OnOff, set Mode (AV 4), FanSpeed (AV 6) and the cooling and heating setpoints, and use BV 16 for network occupancy. Read the effective setpoint, return air temperature, effective mode and fan speed, and DI1 for the alarm relay.",
  "minimum_points": [
