  "enable": "BV 0 OnOff switches the controller on or off (default off) from the BMS, the remote or the touchscreen. With an occupancy function set (AV 14), BV 16 UnoccupiedByNetwork = 1 puts the space unoccupied; it returns to occupied only when DI2 is open and BV 16 is 0. BV 47 disables the DI2 occupancy input so the BMS has sole control.",
  "heartbeat": null,
